Venomaster was used by [[the Organization|Organization]] Suits under the command of Mr. Wilder in an attempt to stop the [[Huntik Foundation|Huntik]] team under [[Dante Vale]] from uncovering information on [[Eathon Lambert]] but was defeated by [[Caliban]] and [[Raijin the Thunderbolt]]. {{source|Doorway to Huntik}}

Venomaster was summoned by one of [[Mr. Wilder|Mr. Wilder's]] Suit to attack Dante and his team. It then fought and was defeated by [[Sophie|Sophie's]] [[Sabriel|Powerbonded Sabriel]]. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}}

Venomaster was summoned to atttack Dante's [[Metagolem]] but was defeated when [[Lucas Casterwill]] and his team interfered. {{source|Chasing Void}}

Venomaster was used by a Suit to defeat Dante's [[Caliban|Powerbonded Caliban]]. It fought along side [[Hoffman|Hoffman's]] [[Myrmidon]] but was defeated in combat. Later [[Hoffman]] attempted to summon Venomaster but he was stopped by [[Sophie Casterwill]] and [[Sabriel|Powerbonded Sabriel]]. {{source|Zhalia's Mission}}
